# Skip optional dependencies on the runner.
#
# Why: this repo's root package.json includes electron-builder, which pulls
# Windows-only optional dependencies (electron-builder-squirrel-windows,
# electron-winstaller, etc.). On Linux runners (Cloudflare Pages, GitHub
# Actions Linux jobs), npm ci fails hard with "Missing: ... from lock file"
# because those optional deps cannot be resolved on Linux.
#
# The cloud/ subproject does not need any of those, so skipping optionals
# is safe for the cloud build pipeline. Local Windows dev is not affected
# (run `npm install --include=optional` explicitly if you need them).
omit=optional
